---
source: examples/calc/tests/cli.rs
expression: "calc(&[\"--help\"])"
---
exit: 0
--- stdout
Calc, a small calculator language built with Langmeld

Usage: calc <COMMAND>

Commands:
  check    Check files and show their problems
  test     Run the corpus files of the language
  explain  Explain a diagnostic code
  lsp      Serve the language to editors over standard input and output
  run      Run a Calc file and show what it shows
  eval     Work out an expression, such as "1 + 2 * 3"
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
--- stderr
